sequenceDiagram
  participant User as Nutzer in Vusyon
  participant Vusyon as Vusyon
  participant Auth as API-Auth / IdP
  participant MCP as MCP-Client in Vusyon
  participant Srv as api2ai MCP Server
  participant Mod as Generierte Tools
  participant API as Backend-API

  User->>Vusyon: Frage / Aufgabe
  Vusyon->>Auth: Login / Token-Refresh
  Auth-->>Vusyon: Access Token oder sealed blob

  Vusyon->>MCP: tools/list, tools/call
  MCP->>Srv: MCP-Protokoll
  Srv->>Mod: invokeTool(...)
  Mod->>API: HTTP laut DSL-Auth
  API-->>Mod: JSON Response
  Mod-->>Srv: Ergebnis
  Srv-->>MCP: Tool-Response
  MCP-->>Vusyon: strukturierte Daten
  Vusyon-->>User: Antwort mit API-Daten
